39,"name":"Jamie Bick","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sQxZfAkn1LiObUZhg9UXLeR7IZv.jpg"},{"id":1718739,"name":"Judith Paus"},{"id":1833664,"name":"Axel Röhrle","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ofhD8xIEeHVYCLpAupkKM35o61Y.jpg"},{"id":1816602,"name":"Emil Schwarz"},{"id":2415829,"name":"Julia Eiber"},{"id":1912262,"name":"Lena Vogt"},{"id":3070494,"name":"Vanessa Fuchs","role":"Model 2","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zAiAeR5BOueQpfioRklT6mEskFF.jpg"},{"id":2317759,"name":"Julia Wulf","role":"Model 1","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9hCh21bGLTqE1lj4X37AEkplWTA.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Vicino all'orizzonte","overview":"Cosa succede quando incontri l’amore della vita sapendo che non potrà durare? Jessica ha 18 anni e un futuro promettente quando un giorno incontra Danny. Bello, affascinante e sicuro di sé, dietro una facciata apparentemente perfetta il ragazzo nasconde in realtà un doloroso segreto. Jessica capisce presto che il futuro che sogna con lui forse non arriverà mai, ma vuole credere fermamente in Danny e nella loro storia. Perché alla fine l’unica cosa che conta davvero non è quanto dura un amore ma quanto è profondo."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Close to the Horizon","overview":"Jessica knows exactly what her life is supposed to look like and where it takes her. But then she meets Danny. He has a complicated past and could confuse all their plans. Jessica has to decide."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Was, wenn du die Liebe deines Lebens triffst und weißt, dass dir nur wenig Zeit bleibt? – Die 18-jährige Jessica ist jung, liebt das Leben und hat Aussichten auf eine vielversprechende Zukunft, als sie sich eines Tages Hals über Kopf in Danny verliebt. Er ist gutaussehend, charmant und selbstbewusst, doch hinter der perfekten Fassade liegt ein dunkles Geheimnis. Und schon bald muss Jessica einsehen, dass es die gemeinsame Zukunft, von der sie geträumt hat, so nicht geben wird. Doch eins ist für sie klar: Sie glaubt an diese Liebe und an Danny. Und sie wird für ihn und diese Liebe kämpfen. Denn am Ende kommt es nicht darauf an, wie lange man geliebt hat, sondern wie tief."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dcL50PP64op9ngWIFCc1rm9MRdM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eTHuVXsUMGGSCCvYdMxpS6KNurZ.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":594634,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dcL50PP64op9ngWIFCc1rm9MRdM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dcL50PP64op9ngWIFCc1rm9MRdM.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dcL50PP64op9ngWIFCc1rm9MRdM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dcL50PP64op9ngWIFCc1rm9MRdM.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kKLyWMzn6Aji86J7KJuApqdkh6q.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kKLyWMzn6Aji86J7KJuApqdkh6q.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"de":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c8K79975Xtoy0i715QLZVpIoPDe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c8K79975Xtoy0i715QLZVpIoPDe.jpg","language":"de","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c8K79975Xtoy0i715QLZVpIoPDe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c8K79975Xtoy0i715QLZVpIoPDe.jpg","language":"de","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tuvVNBRQf0YUVknWfr5340SUsi2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w3